## Remember

**Interface architecture enables:**
- Maintainable and extensible code
- Testable components through mocking
- Flexible system evolution
- Clear separation of concerns
- Consistent system behavior

**Always design with interfaces first, implement with concrete types second, and coordinate through well-defined architectural patterns.**

**Never sacrifice interface-based architecture for quick compilation fixes. Always fix the root cause while maintaining the interface contracts.**

